ump47228491055.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Deep Well Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>​JIADI deep well submersible pump can be installed in a borehole no larger than the pump itself. With their built-in electronics, these pumps are very easy to install and operate. They guarantee a reliable water supply at all times.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52041907\"/></p><p><strong>deep well submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231439234575697.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI deep well submersible pump can be installed in a borehole no larger than the pump itself. With their built-in electronics, these pumps are very easy to install and operate. They guarantee a reliable water supply at all times.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">100QJ5</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">For use with what product?</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Water Well</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">92m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">9 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.75-2.2kW/ 1-3HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor:</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">oil filled, 100% Copper Wire</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item Shape</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">95 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">740mm-1160mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1.25-1.5  inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240/380-415 volts, 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">One year manufacturer's warranty from the purchase date for parts and labor.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231441347944833.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231439206588131.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231442099157832.jpg\"/></p><p>·100% copper wire</p><p>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p><p>·Food grade oil keep the water clean</p><p><br/></p></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Various Choices</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231442199578316.jpg\"/></p><p>·Stainless steel / Copper / Iron available for outlet, suction chamber and oil chamber</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Control Box</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231442285357112.jpg\"/></p><p>·Keep pump constant water pressure without motor overheated or overloaded</p><p>·Fire-resistant material casing</p><p><br/></p></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Cable</p><p><img alt=\"image016(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231442367034196.jpg\"/></p><p>·Four cores cable with durable rubber protecting</p><p>·Cable produced &amp; qualified by JIADI</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Materials</strong></p><p>Stainless steel external shell</p><p>Stainless steel Motor head</p><p>Stainless steel Coupling joint</p><p>Stainless steel Suction grid and screws</p><p>Floating impellers </p><p>Built-in check valve</p><p>Motor coupling flange according to NEMA standards</p><p><strong>MOTOR</strong></p><p>Class